# History of changes

- With every commit, add an entry to `CHANGELOG.md` in the same commit: under today's date (`## YYYY-MM-DD`,
  newest on top), in Russian, what changed for the user — not the code details.
- When the change is visible in the interface, add a screenshot to `docs/screenshots/` and link it from the entry
  (`![…](docs/screenshots/<name>.png)`); update the screenshots in `README.md` when they no longer match.
- After committing (and deploying), push: `git push origin master`. The repository is public: never commit
  secrets — `deploy/kanban.env` stays out of git.
